{"id":"e_poca","lemma":"época","pos":"noun","rank":1069,"glosses":["epoch, era, age, time, day","season, time","period (of time), time period"],"ipa":"/ˈepoka/","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"épocas"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/c/c1/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-AdrianAbdulBaha-%C3%A9poca.wav","examples":[{"text":"Hace calor para esta época del año.","en":"It's warm for this time of year.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/515104","words":[{"g":"to do","l":"hacer"},{"g":"heat"},{"g":"for"},{"g":"this","l":"este"},null,{"g":"of the"},{"g":"year"}]},{"text":"¿Cuál es tu época del año preferida?","en":"What is your favorite time of year?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/707772","words":[{"g":"which one, what, which"},{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"your"},null,{"g":"of the"},{"g":"year"},{"g":"preferred, of choice","l":"preferido"}]},{"text":"Tenemos mucha nieve en esta época del año.","en":"We have a lot of snow at this time of the year.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/65084","words":[{"g":"to have","l":"tener"},{"g":"much","l":"mucho"},{"g":"snow"},{"g":"in / on"},{"g":"this","l":"este"},null,{"g":"of the"},{"g":"year"}]},{"text":"Esta foto me recuerda a mi época de estudiante.","en":"This picture reminds me of when I was a student.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/609012","words":[{"g":"this","l":"este"},{"g":"photo, photograph"},{"g":"me"},{"g":"to remember","l":"recordar"},{"g":"to"},{"g":"my"},null,{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"student"}]},{"text":"En esa época, había pocas doctoras.","en":"There weren't many doctors back then.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/1153251","words":[{"g":"in / on"},{"g":"that","l":"ese"},null,{"g":"makes pluperfect to…"},{"g":"little, not much","l":"poco"},{"g":"doctor","l":"doctor"}]}]}